/**
 * Platform and adaptive trials at depth (roadmap row 124, 17 Sept 2026). The master protocols that changed how cancer
 * drugs are tested: STAMPEDE's successors and cousins across prostate, lung, colorectal, brain, pancreatic and blood
 * cancers, the tumour-agnostic baskets (NCI-MATCH, TAPUR, DART, MyPathway), the UK national screening platforms
 * (National Lung Matrix, FOCUS4, plasmaMATCH, TARGET National, DETERMINE) and the individualised-therapy studies
 * (I-PREDICT, WINTHER, CUPISCO). The `master-protocol` term is the hub: every platform trial here and the I-SPY trials
 * (src/data/ispy-wave.ts) hang off its `related`. STAMPEDE itself is enriched in place in src/data/spikes/prostate.ts.
 *
 * Registry ids and statuses were checked against the ClinicalTrials.gov v2 API and every DOI against Crossref on the
 * day this file was written. Registered in src/data/index.ts.
 */
